  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Supporting EU/UK cooperation, environmental diplomacy in Asia, EU&#xbf;s data flow policy and civil aviation security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action will enable the EU to address short and medium-term foreign policy needs and opportunities by supporting innovative policies and initiatives, and by deepening EU relations and dialogues with target communities, forging alliances and partnerships. In particular, this action will reinforce the EU&#xbf;s new relationship with the United Kingdom; address potential political and economic irritants arising from the new EU Waste Shipment Regulation with key South East Asian countries, while simultaneously strengthening the EU-ASEAN (Association of Southeast Asian Nations) partnership; promote personal data protection frameworks with key partner countries; mitigate the in-coming aviation security threats from flights coming from Partner States by supporting them in effectively implementing the International Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO) aviation security standards.</narrative>
  </description>
